 *    whose target stays inside the workspace are out of scope for the external
 *    boundary.
 *  - Residual (UNC / device-namespace) paths cannot be triggered
 *    deterministically on every host; they are recorded explicitly as
 *    residuals instead of pretending they are covered.
 *
 * The module intentionally performs no network access and spawns no process.
 * It only performs read-only filesystem inspection (`lstat`/`realpath`) and,
 * for trusted sources, computes the resolved target path for the caller.
